{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SpeakSignal 是一款在 iPhone 上練習美式英語發音的應用程式，以內建聲音模型直接在裝置上完成檢查，毋須註冊帳號、訂閱或開發者 API 金鑰，練習可離線進行，音訊不會上傳，亦不會被儲存成錄音。適合想針對個別音素反覆練習的學習者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-100.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>自選音組錄音即時評估</h2>\n<p>程式內置 20 組美式英語音素，涵蓋 TH、L 與 R、food 與 foot 等，每組標明由模型完整檢查或僅部分檢查。你可選擇題目與 Easy、Medium、Hard 難度，或自行輸入最多 80 字英文段落。錄音上限 120 秒，結果卡先給出所選音組的判定，完整報告逐字列出期望與實際讀音，未能判斷之處以問號表示。結果屬模型估算，並非發音認證。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-115-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-116-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-117-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-118-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SpeakSignal</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/speaksignal/id6813969118?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T01:41:07.880360+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":375,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:17:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:54.545359+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:38:27.591711+00:00","content_hash":"4f78770dc10eb644a914c7474ff7828b75740b6df0639dc2cccddfbde0667e8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}